  "findings": {
    "korthos-rewards": "No explicit activation count in the checked bonus entry. The page section describes first/second quest rewards and says both pieces can appear in a reward list; that is acquisition text, not an equip requirement.",
    "prestige-effects": "No explicit activation count in the checked entry or page section. Class levels, enhancement tiers, uses per rest, effect values and table spans do not state how many set pieces activate the bonus. Conditional effects remain unread.",
    "artificer-upgrade": "No explicit activation count in the checked entry or page section. The page requires Nearly Finished effects to be replaced at the Cannith Reforging Station; retain that prerequisite for future activation modeling.",
    "named-equipment": "Equipment relationship is stated, but no explicit numeric or both count in these passages. The named-equipment review report records the full conditions and page sections; do not turn named equipment into an unrestricted two-piece rule.",
    "template-only-gap": "The template entry gives effects without an activation count. A page counterpart states a count separately; do not copy that count into the template comparison or merge source facts silently."
  },
